  <text>
    <body>
      <div>
        <head>In the directories</head>
        <p>Otto Pfortner, hairdresser, is listed at No. 168 <ref target="civic?id=Victoria%20Street">Victoria Street</ref> in 1905.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>On the electoral roll</head>
        <p>Otto Andrew Pfortner, hairdresser, is on the 1905 <ref target="civic?id=Electoral-Rolls">electoral roll</ref> at 168 Victoria Street.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>Neighbours</head>
        <p>The <ref target="civic?id=Bush%20Inn%20hotel">Bush Inn hotel</ref> is next door at No. 170, on the Bouverie Street corner. Mrs S. Rosemann, caterer, is at No. 166.</p>
      </div>
